WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.736
this is one of the strangest materials I&nbsp;
have ever seen.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.000
It is not sticky at all.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.408
You can't even stick regular tape to&nbsp;it.

00:00:11.539 --> 00:00:15.195
But if I drape it over this tomato,

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.624
it holds it up!

00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:20.409
Unless you turn it upside&nbsp;
down,

00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:22.731
in which case it just falls off.

